! Setup

There is nothing to configure to get started.

# Post a link to your tiddler on Bluesky.
# Copy the link of that post. In the Bluesky app, use ''Copy link to post'' from the post menu.
# Add a `bluesky-post` field to the tiddler and paste the link as its value.

A ''Show Bluesky comments'' button then appears at the bottom of the tiddler, and a butterfly button in its toolbar. Tiddlers without the field are left alone.

The field accepts:

* links from bsky.app, such as `https://bsky.app/profile/alice.bsky.social/post/3kxyz...`, and from other clients that use the same URL layout
* links with the account DID in place of the handle
* `at://` URIs

!! What is shown

* The author of each reply, with avatar, name and handle
* The text, with its links, mentions and hashtags
* The date, linking to the reply on Bluesky
* Images and link cards. Quotes and videos get a link to see them on Bluesky
* Replies, reposts and likes counts, unless turned off in the [[settings|$:/plugins/breakzplatform/bluesky-comments/settings/settings]]
* Nested replies, up to the configured depth. Deeper conversations get a link to continue on Bluesky

!! What is hidden

* Replies from people who chose, in their Bluesky settings, not to show their posts to logged-out visitors. Visitors of a wiki are always logged out
* Replies with the moderation labels listed in the settings: by default, adult content, graphic media and spam, whether the label is on the post or on its author
* Replies that the author of the post hid in Bluesky
* Deleted replies and replies from blocked accounts

When a hidden reply has visible answers, a short notice stands in its place so the conversation still makes sense. The others are left out and counted in a link to the full thread on Bluesky.

//Select the next tab to continue.//
